<title>UK: SBAB sets 20 billion yen dual-currency bond.</title>
<headline>SBAB sets 20 billion yen dual-currency bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Wako International (Europe) Ltd and IBJ International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SWEDISH NATIONAL HOUSING FINANCE ((SBAB)</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN YEN    COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL CURRENCY ISS PRICE  100.0     PAY DATE    28.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 100-1M    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION IN U.S. DOLLARS OR YEN</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
